# SOC2 Type II continuous-evidencing case study (v26.7.13 Stage 3) -- the
# ONE genuine exception this re-test cycle surfaces: at Q2, control point
# CTRL-ACCESS-PROVISIONING has an evidence gap (its quarterly access-review
# sample was not collected in time for this quarter's window). This residue
# is the REMEDIATION continuation goal `resolve_continuation_goal` resolves
# for that gap -- a SEPARATE F09 growth descent from q2-retest.ttl's normal
# quarterly re-test, grafted as an independent second child at the same
# Operating Effectiveness Testing socket.
#
# `exception-identified-ctrl-access-provisioning` is asserted in :init here
# because upstream exception surfacing (the real Exception Identification
# phase, audit-exception-id.ttl, in the base 10-phase cycle) is what
# observes the gap in the first place -- this residue models the
# continuation goal GIVEN that observation, not the observation itself.
#
# COMPLIANCE-OVERCLAIM FENCE: the effect is "remediation-applied-ctrl-
# access-provisioning" -- remediation applied, never "compliant". A
# genuinely un-remediable exception (no real corrective action reachable)
# is NOT modeled here -- see unreachable-exception.ttl for that adversarial
# case, which the typed-refusal discipline requires to REFUSE, never
# fabricate a closing action.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "OE-TESTING-GROWTH-Q2-REMEDIATION" ;
    dcterms:description "Q2 exception (CTRL-ACCESS-PROVISIONING evidence gap) remediation residue: a real corrective action exists and is planned + grafted at the OE-Testing socket."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain arclight-soc2-oe-q2-remediation)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (exception-identified-ctrl-access-provisioning ?x)
    (remediation-applied-ctrl-access-provisioning ?x))
  (:action apply-remediation-ctrl-access-provisioning
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (exception-identified-ctrl-access-provisioning ?x))
    :effect (and (remediation-applied-ctrl-access-provisioning ?x))))
""" ;
    ceng:pddlProblem """
(define (problem arclight-soc2-oe-q2-remediation-p)
  (:domain arclight-soc2-oe-q2-remediation)
  (:objects arclight)
  (:init (exception-identified-ctrl-access-provisioning arclight))
  (:goal (and (remediation-applied-ctrl-access-provisioning arclight))))
""" .
